  "status": "present",
  "value": "per-row hash maps of non-zero columns; add merges the other matrix's non-zeros into a copy of the touched rows; multiply converts the operand to per-row non-zero lists and accumulates only non-zero products. Complexity target: O(1) get/set, O(rows cols) add, O(rows cols + nnz(A) * row nnz(B)) multiply/O(nnz) space.",
